#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:6 94298b72f615487dab899e31f5f13cf4
msgid "Part 0 · 部门分享：给 AI 套上缰绳（60 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:8 69d6d5be3c6c416f80a5a9ab2654fde3
msgid ""
"*把整本《Harnessing AI》压成一小时，让部门同事一次听懂 Harness Engineering "
"在讲什么、为什么非做不可、以及周一上班 应该动哪一行代码。*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:12 43907a71b7e445c8ad46c97ed12bdda7
msgid "使用说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:15 e1cdb7c7ef9941788a8621fa2067ac10
msgid ""
"这一部分**不是**一章独立的技术内容，而是整本书的 **60 分钟分享版**。 面向的是 *部门内部同事* —— 前后端工程师，大多数人用过 "
"Cursor / Codex / Claude Code，但没专门做过 harness 系统设计。节奏是 **8 段 × 约 7 分钟 + Q&A"
" 4 分钟**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:20 7b49fad8fad04d56b2a3a52d59a38a82
msgid "`index.md`（本文）—— 可直接通读的讲稿，讲者可以当\"口水稿\"用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:21 d99f2f00f2684cfc926298c6fe302db9
msgid ""
"`outline.md` —— 分钟级 speaker outline，精确到每分钟讲什么， 含**目标 / 钩子 / 可跳 / 别讲 / "
"深一层**五段式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:23 517554aed8f84290917cc6c194a350e9
msgid ""
"`slides.md` —— 每页一张 slide 的大纲（每 `##` 对应一张）， `>` 引用块是 speaker notes，方便复制到 "
"Keynote / Google Slides 的 Outline 视图一次性导入。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:26 3a303693fd984f5eb2b62123e412b2fb
msgid ""
"`../_handson/13-one-hour-talk/SLIDES.md` —— 已经排版好的 Marp "
"兼容版幻灯片（带讲者备注），可直接投影或导出为 PDF。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:29 b9fd74903c0b4c65ba3d8c78c73bcf9e
msgid "书中所有用到的概念、数字、引用，都指向后续章节里的某一章。 这一讲只给 **主脊** —— 不陷入任何一个细节 —— 细节请回到相应 Part。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:32 9e142d33eab949fe9cc1e8b14acad605
msgid ""
"**术语约定**：讲稿里涉及 `CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / SKILL.md / MCP / pre-commit / "
"Bridle / Fence / Paddock / Groom / SDD / TDD / MDD / HarnessCard` "
"这些概念时，**保留英文原词**。这些词 在书里都有精确定义，硬翻反而会丢掉它们的工程意涵。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:38 3b49a4792c504f9986ab6f87666bf74d
msgid "§F.0 · 开场（2 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:40 0e33690b3c3e42f8872d672dcfab3de3
msgid "为什么今天站在这里"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:42 b43cd95802ed4d5db00c8f95cfc96093
msgid ""
"**一句话中心论点.** 2026 年，AI 编码的杠杆点 **从模型本身移到了 模型周围的环境**；我们部门写代码的方式正在被这一转移重塑，而且"
" 再不讨论一次，下一轮 code review 上我们就会各说各话。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:46 d5b8b03a25394e06a3c9a4b5684a0ade
msgid ""
"**白板时刻.** 在白板左边写一个大写的 \"M\"（Model），右边写一个 大写的 \"E\"（Environment）。画一个箭头从 "
"\"M\" 指向 \"E\"，箭头上写 \"2022–2024\"；再画一个箭头从 \"E\" 指向 \"M\"，写 \"2026\"。说： "
"「过去我们想着怎么把模型调得更听话；现在我们想着怎么把环境建 得让一个普通模型也干不坏事。」"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:52 ddb0e52ca2f440cab592d0e21c870498
msgid "**三条 2026 年的事实.** 每条 15 秒："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:54 e648dd74aae5473a98e229f9fe18c5b5
msgid "**OpenAI 的 Codex 团队**，8 周内上线约 **100 万行生产代码**， 其中 **0 行由人手写**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:56 e9cfcde0563d4825b4364bf0b18ac680
msgid "**LangChain 团队** 没换模型，只改了模型 *周围的脚手架*，就把 Terminal Bench 2.0 成绩从第 30 名冲进前 5。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:58 53f63066d8ac4332960befe9fc02f926
msgid "**Anthropic** 在 *权限弹窗、技能编写规范、MCP server 契约* 上 花的工程时间，比花在模型权重上的多。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:61 0740f75553cd49cb8345d7d598c89782
msgid "**回书链接.** 《Foreword》（第 01 章）及《The Four-Stage Evolution》（第 02 章）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:63 8ef2060b12af4117a57b292e9272136a
msgid "§F.1 · 起点：四个阶段（7 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:65 f3a9f38f1d124c359c6402bef1475e79
msgid "从 Prompt 到 Harness，为什么每一步都卡在下一步面前"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:67 c015fe332cd74698928eaa009843494e
msgid ""
"**一句话中心论点.** 工作工程师跟大模型协作的方式，在 2022–2026 年 间经历了 "
"**四阶段演化**；每一个阶段都解决了上一阶段无法解决的问题， 也都有一个上一阶段观察不到的新问题。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:71 aa2b16c2b59640bca12a3a0a564f4a38
msgid "**白板时刻.** 画一条时间轴，标四个节点："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:73 0bbc50778f9449d0b255a3177d15458d
msgid ""
"2022–2024     2025          2025–2026       2026–\n"
"Prompt   →   Context   →   Skill       →   Harness\n"
"怎么问？    给看什么？    怎么把流程写下来？  造什么环境？\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:79 ff432e8a8f7447f3a5bba198e2c5a056
msgid "每一步的 **主要人工制品**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:81 f46b2f44dc08481abfe9e890650a4c81
msgid "**Prompt**：一条巧妙的提示字符串。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:82 d59c1592ece943bea631a21e80fc6d07
msgid "**Context**：一张检索 ／ 上下文图。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:83 607f6918338142a5be678c183ea76989
msgid "**Skill**：一份 `SKILL.md` 或 command 定义。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:84 ace763f1f0b8486e9523777e4c413cea
msgid "**Harness**：**仓库本身** —— `CLAUDE.md` ＋ 护栏 ＋ 钩子 ＋ 巡检。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:86 ad1e0aa49f2242e6ad82b491ae808d4b
msgid "**两句要带走的话.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:88 ca6c5b0d845d42238e0c107ec4d104d8
msgid "*前三个阶段都在调「询问层」，Harness 阶段把干预点移到了「环境层」。*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:89 b0c2326b52a84a4283fb576618d004c1
msgid "*前三个阶段可以一个工程师单独做，Harness 必须以仓库为单位做。*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:91 7b9d2fed12684b8b88c51b103b88072e
msgid ""
"**一个要提防的误读.** \"Harness 就是 prompt 长一点。\" 不是。Prompt 是 "
"一次对话一次性塞进去的文本；Harness 是留在仓库里、下一轮智能体 也会读到、且违反就被机械拒绝的那一组制品。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:95 a7e02105e1ea4c3391e386633d9f1e51
msgid ""
"**回书链接.** 第 02 章《The Four-Stage Evolution》完整论证，尤其是 Stage 1 / 2 / 3 "
"各自裂缝的那三段。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:98 e66a1277466c47f6b20384e6f8f7678b
msgid "§F.2 · 定义：Harness Engineering 是什么（7 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:100
#: 3e5daec4545842cbae35b295b3f0320e
msgid "一句话定义，五条「是」，五条「不是」"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:102
#: 13e0e9798d214f1187046c57e6ed0247
msgid ""
"**一句话中心论点.** *Harness Engineering 是一门 **刻意设计、运行、 演化 AI 编码智能体周围结构** "
"的工程学科，目的是让它产出的软件 **可验证、可观测、可理解**。*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:106
#: ed1d19187d59495188f2c5a701638eb5
msgid "**白板时刻.** 在 \"一句话定义\" 下面写三个竖排的字："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:108
#: 601f50dea5364a3d8ad17a57294cb85f
msgid ""
"可验证   verifiable\n"
"可观测   observable\n"
"可理解   understandable\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:114
#: 36e79485738b4b2f900594b1125536e6
msgid "然后说：「这三词不是修辞，每一个背后都有一门四十年历史的工程学科。 我们马上讲。」"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:117
#: c5f33e98e9e8491baae81d55d9cef5e9
msgid "**五条「是」（快念）.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:119
#: e423da2c82fa499386aaf360c005205b
msgid ""
"**面向智能体的规约** —— `CLAUDE.md` ／ `AGENTS.md` ／ `SKILL.md` ／ MCP server "
"manifest，把它们当代码 review。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:121
#: 52b793f4996445cda08443d87423c816
msgid "**审批门与护栏** —— pre-commit 钩子、lint 规则、PR 强制评审、 CI 必过项。无论作者是人还是 AI，坏制品一律拦。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:123
#: 52d0106d6b7449f3b46f68d9217016cf
msgid "**沙箱** —— 容器 ／ VM ／ 只读挂载 ／ 临时 worktree，让智能体碰 不到生产。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:125
#: c8c62bc86d984674b0ac951269b43bff
msgid "**面向智能体的文档** —— runbook ／ ADR ／ skill 文件，智能体自己 能读懂，以减少环境幻觉。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:127
#: c5a9e9a0c2114c8e8acd45d84a2ed580
msgid "**度量与反馈面** —— 测试通过率、每轮成本、lint 违规数、 from-fail-to-green 时间，团队 *每周* 看一次。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:130
#: c507fbe73bb74a848058fc611ba1c4f7
msgid "**五条「不是」（更快念）.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:132
#: 1d60725e61d74b9891a668ea84cacbc4
msgid "**不是** 推理运行栈（那是 AI Engineering）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:133
#: 0df989f17514428a802f3ec440b287a2
msgid "**不是** ML 评测基准（那是输入，不是本体）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:134
#: dd581b79c6634aaa93d6e5a74c6482b3
msgid "**不是** IDE 插件（Cursor ／ Copilot 是客户端，harness 住在仓库里）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:135
#: ae11d60df2cb4718bc71969ed869d068
msgid "**不是** 智能体框架 SDK（LangChain ／ AutoGen 是砖块，不是房子）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:136
#: 756e4cfdc98b423c8d715f56eb509a34
msgid "**不是** 部署流水线（DevOps 接管于 \"commit 合入之后\"）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:138
#: ec56f07c3ce244dd8c39921c94ba7d4f
msgid ""
"**归属检验.** *如果一件制品塑造智能体 **在 commit 之前** 试图 产出什么，它属于 harness；如果它塑造 commit "
"**之后** 发生什么， 它属于 DevOps。*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:142
#: 03546b9789054787b284bf0e3e7b2cfc
msgid ""
"**回书链接.** 第 03 章《What is Harness Engineering?》，尤其是 §03.1 一句话定义与 §03.2 "
"的「IS ／ IS NOT」归属边界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:145
#: a45bb64faf1c4927a7b23697ca9dfd2d
msgid "§F.3 · 三护法：SDD → TDD → MDD（7 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:147
#: d22aa9b70ec341d6a62ecedced8b159f
msgid "为什么有了智能体以后，因果顺序反了"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:149
#: 2fa2a6f0bfaf4104b66b917b90fcaa8f
msgid ""
"**一句话中心论点.** Harness Engineering 不发明新学科，它 **征召三门 旧学科**，把它们 "
"**重新排序**、前置到智能体动笔之前：**SDD → TDD → MDD**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:152
#: c9aa7ae76fe44f7ba6a08781042ecd3e
msgid "**白板时刻.** 画两条因果链，上下对照："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:154
#: 448a246ea3e94269a4bed8211efa2508
msgid ""
"传统软件工程 ：   test   →   implement   →   observe\n"
"(人写代码)          TDD         (人)           MDD\n"
"\n"
"AI 辅助工程  ：   specify   →   test     →    observe\n"
"(智能体写代码)     SDD          TDD           MDD\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:162
#: e17a87c2d7274bdcaca30f90357f3844
msgid ""
"**为什么翻转？** 在人写代码时代，测试是第一份可执行规约，人会 顶着它改到合为止；**在智能体时代，人写的主要制品移到更上游 "
"——`CLAUDE.md` ／ `AGENTS.md` ／ skill 文件**。如果规约含糊， "
"智能体会非常自信地幻觉出一种行为，这时写的测试只会把幻觉钉住， 而不是抓住它。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:168
#: 7de6cff072a047da9e497f729a9f2694
msgid "**三护法各一句.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:170
#: ff3e203e40b34db3b987d2e222d0465f
msgid ""
"**SDD — Specification-Driven Development.** *可理解性护法。* "
"把意图变成智能体能读的规约（`AGENTS.md` ／ ADR ／ prompt 规约）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:172
#: 3c45770a20204f25aa6e05b3c999f7eb
msgid ""
"**TDD — Test-Driven Development.** *可验证性护法。* 先写那条 \"还红着\" "
"的测试，作为智能体对规约的解释之证伪面。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:174
#: f4a66a9b62ab494b821bf2cd78e9b4d8
msgid ""
"**MDD — Metric-Driven Development.** *可观测性护法。* 把每轮 turns-to-"
"green、每月成本、lint 违规数等指标写下来，每周看。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:177
#: 605a1689443147019250ea6707985063
msgid ""
"**一个要提防的误读.** 「我们已经有 CI 了啊。」CI 只是 TDD ／ MDD 的 **牧场**。它在合入那一刻才发声；Harness "
"的问题是在键盘按下那一刻 发声。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:181
#: 3cb07e4a77d846c59e39cd95f5604a65
msgid "**回书链接.** 第 04 章《The Three Guardians》，特别是「为什么因果 顺序要翻转」那一节。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:184
#: 316550204def411d8455b444b04a070a
msgid "§F.4 · 骨架：3 × 4 矩阵（7 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:186
#: 0842b34cbaad41bf95faf79ddddf41e0
msgid "一张表，十二格，装下整个框架"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:188
#: 3434dd11a9d846648c0f1f75d61eadd1
msgid "**一句话中心论点.** 画不出来的框架是口号，不是分析工具。本书的 分析骨架是一张 **3 × 4 矩阵**：三行 ＝ 三护法，四列 ＝ 四区域。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:191
#: 3183e3d0d60e46fcba90eaa3e10be876
msgid "**白板时刻.** 直接画这张表："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:193
#: bf25fc04c021436cacf31cbbddc3eec8
msgid ""
"              缰绳           护栏         牧场          梳理\n"
"              Bridle         Fence        Paddock       Groom\n"
"              (写前引导)     (写时拒绝)    (写后边界)     (维持本身)\n"
"\n"
"SDD (说)      AGENTS.md      prompt-lint  acceptance   sources-of-truth\n"
"                             schema 校验   gate         索引\n"
"\n"
"TDD (证)      pre-edit       pre-commit   CI / 集成     flaky\n"
"              钩子导引        钩子拒绝     测试          隔离\n"
"\n"
"MDD (观)      北极星指标      成本上限      SLI 面板      指标元审\n"
"              放在显眼处      触顶拒调用    红线          季度轮替\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:208
#: c0d14f5e55584621b180867fa69e7087
msgid "**四区域各一句.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:210
#: 5e042cc20269447e9b41e7d0750cc5e7
msgid "**Bridle（缰绳）** —— 智能体敲第一个键之前 *看什么、听什么*。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:211
#: c531181e4c914d2c96e1ea9cde342fef
msgid "**Fence（护栏）** —— 不管作者是谁，*一律拒绝* 坏制品。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:212
#: fef9d89a4b0548e38886ba09ac8498e1
msgid "**Paddock（牧场）** —— 智能体 *可以撒欢的那块地* 的边界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:213
#: 361295206f9c428ebc16df85f7c7ed30
msgid "**Groom（梳理）** —— 维护 *挽具本身* 的那些重复性工作。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:215
#: 6967113be03f43a1a29ce18af8612572
msgid "**三个配对的学术框架（各 10 秒）.**"
