#: 931667be79284f65889adbbab10eeccd
msgid ""
"**CAR ／ HarnessCard**（学术参考）：Control ／ Agency ／ Runtime "
"三层分解，配一份标准化披露格式。本书案例研究打分的骨架。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:219
#: 4100880b18f54acc807f886772069c8b
msgid ""
"**Thoughtworks 三分法**：context engineering ＋ architectural constraints ＋ "
"garbage collection。最像 DevOps 的那一种。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:221
#: 0307b6b02b334d1ea1ca416d8f9da651
msgid ""
"**LangChain 五件套**：prompts / tools / middleware / memory / harness。 对单个 "
"agent 实例最细的切法。"
msgstr ""

