msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:235
#: 13553bcafb084b21b6b0f1027d947d53
msgid ""
"OpenHarness   Superpowers   lazy-scrum-team   Claude Code\n"
"运行时 + 沙箱  技能库        工作流编码         闭源产品\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:240
#: ab6a4291b80948db9825bab060b21a24
msgid "**每一个案例一句话.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:242
#: 8fa3bd53e7bd4186b848a82f589cd059
msgid ""
"**OpenHarness（第 07 章，港大 DS Lab，开源）** —— *唯一一份 \"就像读过第 05 章之后才写的\" "
"开源参考实现*。十个子系统整齐对 应到矩阵格子；Runtime 层 Paddock 尤其强。警醒：它是参考实现， 不是你的运行时。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:246
#: 32a52a8d4a0d488fa72a77df0d6cb91f
msgid ""
"**Superpowers（第 08 章，Joseph Vincent，开源）** —— *OpenHarness "
"的哲学反面。只出技能库，不出运行时*。三十几份 `SKILL.md`， 强在 SDD × Bridle。警醒：\"光靠技能能不能做我们的挽具？\""
" —— *不能*，少了 Fence 与 Paddock。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:250
#: c9a4f0ccc7ee41d993fd3de5a6f27c19
msgid ""
"**lazy-scrum-team（第 09 章，开源 skill 包）** —— *把 Scrum 角色 "
"与交接本身当挽具*。三件可复用的模式：Artefact State Model、 Rework Matrix、Hard vs Soft "
"Gates。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:253
#: ffb1e0c5aadb4763829e8ec09834ecc5
msgid ""
"**Claude Code（第 10 章，Anthropic，闭源；经由张汉东《马书》分析）** —— *本书唯一的闭源案例*。挽具职责分布在 "
"bundled prompt ＋ hooks 契约 ＋ skills 系统 *三处*。警醒：闭源意味着你看得到行为但拿不到源， "
"分析结论永远带一个有效期标注。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:258
#: 66f98a5cc54d47579a486f75faa61994
msgid "**一句带走.** *矩阵是尺子，案例是用它量出来的刻度；要你部门抄 作业，选一个最接近你们技术栈的案例。*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:261
#: 64125807a2bb4ea682edeea19f3ee66c
msgid "**回书链接.** 第 07–10 章全部。每一章末尾都有一张填好的 HarnessCard， 可直接当\"别人是怎么打分的\"的参照。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:264
#: ae3d72dad7994e5f85c3650f73f7611f
