#: b4e660abf32b47de8146f9baa429b642
msgid "本书对自己的那座仓库做了一次审计，然后改了五处"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:268
#: dc4785e3b23c484ea802db56dbdde293
msgid ""
"**一句话中心论点.** *如果这套框架连书的宿主仓库自己都打不分、 改不动，那它就是错的。* 本书第 11 章把 3 × 4 矩阵扣在 "
"`walterfan/lazy-ai-coder` 自己头上，做了一场四幕实盘。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:272
#: 79154ab5b041481194321769c0fca961
msgid "**白板时刻.** 画四个方块横向排开："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:274
#: 338e3d526e2346fa8ea5544ed4d964d8
msgid ""
"Act 1       Act 2         Act 3         Act 4\n"
"审计        短板          实盘修复       度量 delta\n"
"(Audit)     (Shortcomings) (Fixes)       (Measure)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:280
#: e2ac39d7099d4eed9f5c9790f476317b
msgid "**四幕各一句.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:282
#: bbb0d704b39c4381b05303dd1641c3e3
msgid ""
"**Act 1 · 审计.** 填一张初始 HarnessCard，落在矩阵的 **左下角** ——SDD × Fence、SDD × "
"Groom、TDD × Fence、MDD × Bridle ／ Groom 是五格最弱的。不是烂仓库，是「有普通可生存技术债」的仓库。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:285
#: 46cd7a827833414e913322165683fe23
msgid "**Act 2 · 短板.** 列出五个具体短板，每一个都 **打上严重度、 证据指针、落到哪一格**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:287
#: d7d5a35050a74d0a920568e5d2caaf67
msgid "缺 `make prompts-lint`（SDD × Fence）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:288
#: e49b3d67dce549218af8f142335187c5
msgid "MCP 工具 schema 没对齐 handler（TDD × Fence）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:289
#: 1832b1163f0c47099614cc04a8f2e96c
msgid "没有 LLM 调用的成本可观测面板（MDD × Bridle）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:290
#: c765682e28b64b318151568a011c6294
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:291
#: f0a1b2d57afc4b79b43f75548c80b06a
msgid "**Act 3 · 修复.** 五笔真实 commit 进 main；`reproduce.sh` 可复现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:292
#: 380a4d1579034301b9b0c9f4cda9e283
msgid "**Act 4 · 度量 delta.** 重新打分："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:293
#: b60279c584f64963807c42b22bd7d88b
msgid "SDD 均值 1.75 → 3.00（+1.25）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:294
#: 2ca29f9ff0ed4f449e80f5b3378dfd45
msgid "TDD 均值 2.00 → 2.75（+0.75）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:295
#: 5adfcf80fe9b45868a21efd1735b4ea3
msgid "MDD 均值 1.50 → 1.50（+0.00，没动）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:296
#: e86f73804c5547bf9b867a77a0b2a8d2
msgid "**总分 1.75 → 2.42（+0.67）**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:298
#: a695d52567c14b61b98ff0c266889e66
msgid ""
"**一个要提防的误读.** 「HarnessCard 就是虚荣分数。」不是。只要你 把评分尺（附录 D）公开、把证据指针公开、把变化 delta "
"公开，它就 不是虚荣分数。\"分数涨了但事故没少\" ——那才是 *vanity delta*。"
msgstr ""

