#: abdb6e6ab6b644538ba3bc65cfa81c91
msgid ""
"**回书链接.** 第 11 章《Lazy AI Coder Four-Act Worked Example》与 附录 D《HarnessCard"
" Template》。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:305
#: 90e076fd82aa4b36bf67548777b3f225
msgid "§F.7 · 周一上班怎么办：30 ／ 60 ／ 90 天清单（7 分钟）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:307
#: 503bab4a65a44287b069ff05871692e2
msgid "最重要的一条：你不用一次性做完十二格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:309
#: 832c6a1d80bb40369cf890a24ed76733
msgid ""
"**一句话中心论点.** *本书最重要的单一主张：你不必一次上 12 格。 你挑 **一格**，上它；然后上它所在的 **整行** 或 "
"**整列**；再走一 次完整的 HarnessCard 评审。*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:313
#: 2bc85f374d7c445fa4b28bb69f1fd412
msgid "**白板时刻.** 画三个里程碑："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:315
#: 02655d55d6ea48f286456c6473a96c8a
msgid ""
"Day 1–30        Day 31–60           Day 61–90\n"
"一格            一行 或 一列         一次完整评审\n"
"one cell        one row or column   full HarnessCard review\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:321
#: 469e1aab60ab48f1a1ae15483eee3125
msgid "**每一段的推荐切入点.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:323
#: cadae98ea6fb4516a146451078260d71
msgid "**Day 1–30 · 一格.** 推荐从下面三者挑一个："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:324
#: 7e72ff6f15c4464eb5ce0c2a517e8b09
msgid "**SDD × Bridle** —— 提交一份基于样本的 `AGENTS.md`。便宜，之后 每一轮都赚。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:326
#: 45efad28d0a14a1dbebbc35d4a7584b3
msgid "**TDD × Fence** —— 装一条 `PreToolUse` 钩子，测试红的时候拒绝 写文件。单兵也能受益。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:328
#: 300b7608582a4f52a2d8bcfbeeffa9e1
msgid "**MDD × Fence** —— 给 LLM 调用加一个每会话成本上限。过线就 拒绝新调用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:330
#: 72072fcac5274342833e061b6c78bf3c
msgid "**Day 31–60 · 一行 或 一列.** 把第一格扩到所在的整行（同一护法下 补齐四个区域）或整列（同一区域下补齐三个护法）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:332
#: 8e326a94e7d24fcea12ec2fb48c7e12d
msgid "**Day 61–90 · 一次完整评审.** 按附录 D 的评分尺打一张 HarnessCard， 公开 delta。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:335
#: ed352f12d4d34731b6ce45c834ac8c1c
msgid "**三条要提防的误读（快念）.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:337
#: 49cd9e9f134b4dc6a9c1f6c9e1f73256
msgid "**\"Day 30 我们就搞定了\"陷阱** —— 没人给挽具本身排维护班，90 天后 那格的分数从 +1 掉回 +0.3。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:339
#: cd57e75fc0cd40dd8adf325d2499d990
msgid "**\"Groom 以后再说\"陷阱** —— 一开始就没把梳理列入范围；没有 `Groom` 的挽具不是挽具，是装饰。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:341
#: b3c220e7397c490da772981d56fa8a95
msgid ""
"**\"凑齐了再发布\"陷阱** —— 等到十二格都 ≥ 3 分才敢上线。错了。 你要的是「一格上线 ＋ 公开承认其余十一格的分数」，而不是 "
"「全格就绪的神话」。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/part0-presentation/index.md:345
#: decb8b20813c468c9e6c74f8167ad389
msgid ""
"**回书链接.** 第 12 章《Where We Go from Here》§12.2「30／60／90-Day Action "
"Checklist」与其配套的 pitfalls。"
msgstr ""

